cf.2025","HPE.capex.2025","HPE.revenue.2025","HPE.ocf.2020","HPE.capex.2020"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $643 million in FY2025, 1.9% of revenue, against 1% in FY2020.","cites":["HPE.sbc.2025","HPE.revenue.2025","HPE.sbc.2020","HPE.revenue.2020"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2025 the company paid $202 million to repurchase its own shares and $684 million in dividends: $886 million together (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["HPE.buybacks.2025","HPE.dividends.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-07-31 revenue was $12.2 billion, up 33.7% from $9.1 billion in the three months ended 2025-07-31.","cites":["HPE.d.revenue.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","HPE.d.revenue.2025-05-01.2025-07-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-07-31 revenue added up to $41.9 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $2.6 billion and net income to $2.8 billion.","cites":["HPE.d.revenue.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","HPE.d.revenue.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","HPE.d.revenue.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","HPE.d.revenue.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","HPE.d.revenue.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","HPE.d.opinc.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","HPE.d.opinc.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","HPE.d.opinc.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","HPE.d.opinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","HPE.d.opinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","HPE.d.netinc.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","HPE.d.netinc.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","HPE.d.netinc.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","HPE.d.netinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","HPE.d.netinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $4.2 billion: operating cash flow of $6.7 billion less capital spending of $2.5 billion (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["HPE.d.ocf.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","HPE.d.ocf.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","HPE.d.ocf.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","HPE.d.ocf.2025-11-01.2026-04-30","HPE.d.ocf.2025-11-01.2026-07-31","HPE.d.capex.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","HPE.d.capex.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","HPE.d.capex.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","HPE.d.capex.2025-11-01.2026-04-30","HPE.d.capex.2025-11-01.2026-07-31"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $10.3 billion at the end of FY2025, against $7.5 billion a year earlier. That is 30% of FY2025 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["HPE.rpo.2025","HPE.rpo.2024","HPE.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $10.3 billion at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $7.5 billion a year earlier.","cites":["HPE.deferred.2025","HPE.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 67,000 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $512,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["HPE.q.employees","HPE.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2025 annual report tags a goodwill impairment of $1.6 billion.","cites":["HPE.impairment.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $5.8 billion in cash and cash equivalents, and $22.4 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtAndCapitalLeaseObligations + DebtCurrent). Debt less cash was $16.6 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["HPE.cash.2025","HPE.debtLong.2025","HPE.debtCurrent.2025"]}]},"fin":{"HPE":{}},"quotes":{"HPE.q.employees":{"c":"HPE","kind":"employees","n":67000,"quote":"Our company strives to be an engine of innovation, and our approximately 67,000 employees as of October 31, 2025, are proud of the ways our technology enables our customers to achieve meaningful outcomes like curing disease, modernizing farming, addressing world-hunger, and democratizing transportation through autonomous vehicles.","source":"HPE-0001645590-25-000130","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2025-12-18","proof":"c4801c8503c2ac79880308099a0f4b07db98652e37db00528cdfce9588cbbac9"}}}